---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const faq = [
 {
  "q": "Is Bloc a licensed bank?",
  "a": "Yes. Bloc Microfinance Bank is licensed by the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits are insured by the NDIC, subject to its limits."
 },
 {
  "q": "What do I need to open an account?",
  "a": "Your phone number, email, BVN, NIN and a selfie. You do everything in the app."
 },
 {
  "q": "Why do you ask for my BVN and NIN?",
  "a": "Nigerian banks must confirm who you are. We use these details to check your identity and nothing else."
 },
 {
  "q": "How do I add money?",
  "a": "Send money to your Bloc account number from any bank or app. The app shows your number and lets you share it as an image."
 },
 {
  "q": "What if a transfer is slow?",
  "a": "The app shows it as pending. Your money is safe. If it fails, we return it and tell you when it is back."
 },
 {
  "q": "Can I use Bloc on two phones?",
  "a": "One phone is active at a time. When you move to a new phone, access pauses for a short time to protect your money."
 },
 {
  "q": "Can I save and borrow with Bloc?",
  "a": "Yes. Set a savings goal in the app. Loans need a few extra checks. We show what you pay each month before you confirm."
 },
 {
  "q": "How do I get help?",
  "a": "Chat with us in the app, or email support@blocmfb.com."
 }
];
---
<Layout title="Personal banking in Nigeria | Bloc Microfinance Bank" description="Open a Bloc personal account on your phone. Send money to any Nigerian bank, pay bills, buy airtime and data, and save toward a goal. CBN licensed." path="/personal/" section="personal" breadcrumb={[{"name": "Personal banking", "path": "/personal/"}]} faq={faq} preload="/assets/photo-personal.webp">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="h1"><div class="w"><div class="hl"><div class="chip"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg><span>Licensed by the CBN. Insured by NDIC.</span></div>
<h1 id="h1">Everyday banking<br>on your phone.</h1><p class="sub">Send money, save, borrow and pay bills from your phone.</p><div class="stores"><a class="store l" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/bloc-microfinance-bank/id6788473815" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="si"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#0B2E66" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.152 6.896c-.948 0-2.415-1.078-3.96-1.04-2.04.027-3.91 1.183-4.961 3.014-2.117 3.675-.546 9.103 1.519 12.09 1.013 1.454 2.208 3.09 3.792 3.039 1.52-.065 2.09-.987 3.935-.987 1.831 0 2.35.987 3.96.948 1.637-.026 2.676-1.48 3.676-2.948 1.156-1.688 1.636-3.325 1.662-3.415-.039-.013-3.182-1.221-3.22-4.857-.026-3.04 2.48-4.494 2.597-4.559-1.429-2.09-3.623-2.324-4.39-2.376-2-.156-3.675 1.09-4.61 1.09zM15.53 3.83c.843-1.012 1.4-2.427 1.245-3.83-1.207.052-2.662.805-3.532 1.818-.78.896-1.454 2.338-1.273 3.714 1.338.104 2.715-.688 3.559-1.701"/></svg></span><span class="st"><small>Download on the</small><b>App Store</b></span></a><a class="store l" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.blocmfb.mobile" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="si"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#00A0FF" d="M3.6 1.6 14 12 3.6 22.4c-.4-.3-.6-.8-.6-1.4V3c0-.6.2-1.1.6-1.4z"/><path fill="#00E27A" d="M3.6 1.6c.4-.3 1-.3 1.6 0l12 6.9-3.2 3.5z"/><path fill="#FFCE00" d="m17.2 8.5 3.6 2.1c.8.5.8 1.7 0 2.2l-3.6 2.1L14 12z"/><path fill="#FF3A44" d="m5.2 22.4 12-6.9-3.2-3.5-10.4 10.4c.6.2 1.2.2 1.6 0z"/></svg></span><span class="st"><small>Get it on</small><b>Google Play</b></span></a></div><div class="hnote"><span>You need your BVN, NIN and a selfie.</span><a href="#how">See how it works</a></div></div><div class="hp"><img class="pimg" src="/assets/photo-personal.webp" alt="A young woman smiling at her phone on a Lagos street" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="fc c1"><span class="fi2"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></span><span>Transfer successful<small>₦25,000.00 to Chika Obi</small></span></div><div class="fc c2"><span class="fi2"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg></span><span>Available balance<small>₦148,250.00</small></span></div></div></div></section><section class="stmt" aria-label="Regulation"><div class="w"><div><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Regulation</span></div><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Licensed by the CBN.<br>Insured by the NDIC.</h2>
<p>Bloc Microfinance Bank operates under a licence from the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits are insured by the Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation, subject to its limits.</p></div>
<div class="sl"><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="141" height="150" src="/assets/reg-cbn.png" alt="CBN logo"></div><div><b>Licensed by the CBN</b><span>Central Bank of Nigeria</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="420" height="178" src="/assets/reg-ndic.png" alt="NDIC logo"></div><div><b>Insured by NDIC</b><span>Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="160" height="160" src="/assets/reg-ndpc.png" alt="NDPC logo"></div><div><b>NDPA compliant</b><span>Nigeria Data Protection Act</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="scene" id="scene" aria-label="The Bloc app"><div class="sc-pin"><div class="w">
<div class="sc-copy"><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>The app</span></div><h2>Everyday money, in one app.</h2><div class="sc-caps"><div class="sc-cap on"><span class="sc-n">01</span><h3>Send money.</h3><p>Pick a bank, enter an amount, and check the name and fee before you confirm.</p></div><div class="sc-cap"><span class="sc-n">02</span><h3>Save toward a goal.</h3><p>Create a savings plan with a target, then watch it grow in the app.</p></div><div class="sc-cap"><span class="sc-n">03</span><h3>Borrow with clarity.</h3><p>See what you will repay each month before you accept a loan.</p></div></div><div class="sc-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i></div></div>
<div class="sc-phone"><div class="sc-frame"><img class="sc-img on" src="/assets/app-SendReview.webp" alt="Send money review screen" width="780" height="1688" loading="lazy"><img class="sc-img" src="/assets/app-SaveCreate.webp" alt="New savings target plan screen" width="780" height="1688" loading="lazy"><img class="sc-img" src="/assets/app-LoanHub.webp" alt="Loan screen with monthly repayment" width="780" height="1688" loading="lazy"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec sky" id="what"><div class="w">
