<h2>Personal banking products.</h2>
<div class="grid4 g6">
<article class="card"><div class="ib ch" style="background:var(--gold)"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/></svg></div><h3>Send money</h3><p>To any Nigerian bank. You see the fee before you confirm.</p><div class="crop"><div class="ph" style="--pw:230px;"><img src="/assets/app-SendTo.webp" alt="Bloc app send money screen with favourites and recent recipients" width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"></div></div></article>
