<article class="card"><div class="ib ch" style="background:var(--cream)"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 5c-1.5 0-2.8 1.4-3 2-3.5-1.5-11-.3-11 5 0 1.8 0 3 2 4.5V20h4v-2h3v2h4v-4c1-.5 1.7-1 2-2h2v-4h-2c0-1-.5-1.5-1-2V5z"/><path d="M2 9v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h1"/><path d="M16 11h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Save money</h3><p>Set a savings goal and track your progress.</p><div class="crop"><div class="ph" style="--pw:230px;"><img src="/assets/app-SaveCreate.webp" alt="Bloc app new target plan screen with goal, amount and date" width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"></div></div></article>
