<article class="card"><div class="ib ch" style="background:var(--coral)"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg></div><h3>Your account</h3><p>Limits, statements and security, all in one place.</p><div class="crop"><div class="ph" style="--pw:230px;"><img src="/assets/app-Account.webp" alt="Bloc app account screen with security, limits and statements" width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"></div></div></article>
</div>
</div></section><section class="sec how" id="how"><div class="w"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>How it works</span></div>
<h2>Open an account on your phone.</h2>
<div class="steps">
<div class="step"><div class="num ch">1</div><div><b>Download the app</b><span>Create your sign-in with your phone number and email.</span></div></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num ch">2</div><div><b>Verify yourself</b><span>Add your BVN and NIN, then take a selfie.</span></div></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num ch">3</div><div><b>Start banking</b><span>Your account number is ready when we finish checking.</span></div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="trio"><i class="bg ch"></i>
<div class="ph" style="--pw:200px;"><img src="/assets/app-KycConsent.webp" alt="Bloc app identity check start screen" width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"></div>
