<p>Every transfer shows its fee first. Read the full guide to charges any time.</p></div>
<a class="btn p" href="#legal">Read the guide to charges <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="sec faq" id="faq"><div class="w"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Help</span></div>
<h2>Frequently asked questions.</h2>
<p class="lead">Still stuck? Chat with us in the app or email <a href="mailto:support@blocmfb.com">support@blocmfb.com</a>.</p></div>
<div><details><summary>Is Bloc a licensed bank?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Bloc Microfinance Bank is licensed by the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits are insured by the NDIC, subject to its limits.</p></details><details><summary>What do I need to open an account?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Your phone number, email, BVN, NIN and a selfie. You do everything in the app.</p></details><details><summary>Why do you ask for my BVN and NIN?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Nigerian banks must confirm who you are. We use these details to check your identity and nothing else.</p></details><details><summary>How do I add money?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Send money to your Bloc account number from any bank or app. The app shows your number and lets you share it as an image.</p></details><details><summary>What if a transfer is slow?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>The app shows it as pending. Your money is safe. If it fails, we return it and tell you when it is back.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use Bloc on two phones?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>One phone is active at a time. When you move to a new phone, access pauses for a short time to protect your money.</p></details><details><summary>Can I save and borrow with Bloc?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Set a savings goal in the app. Loans need a few extra checks. We show what you pay each month before you confirm.</p></details><details><summary>How do I get help?<span class="pm"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Chat with us in the app, or email support@blocmfb.com.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="dl" id="download"><div class="w"><div class="dbox ch">
